6. **Notices.** A notice to the Licensor is made by opening an issue in the repository https://github.com/SamuelNDCE/Meerkat or by writing to the contact address listed there. A notice to You may be sent to any address or account the Licensor reasonably thinks reaches You, including a public message in a repository where You publish.
